# Whether the app answers taps, as scripts/responds asks before every install, in one pass: open
# like a book each tab takes its page, a row opens its page beside Now and it loads, and Calls,
# Tasks and Settings open from the bars and go Back; then folded, Goals and a row's page over Now.
launch /
shows home-list-now
press tab-goals
shows home-list-goals
press tab-feed
shows home-list-feed
press tab-ideas
shows home-list-ideas
press tab-now
shows home-list-now
press home-row-*
shows task-pane
gone task-loading
press bar-calls
shows calls
press bar-back
shows home-list-now
press bar-tasks
shows tasks
gone tasks-loading
press bar-back
shows home-list-now
press bar-settings
shows settings-body
press bar-back
shows home-list-now
pose cover-up
shows home-list-now
press tab-goals
shows home-list-goals
press tab-now
shows home-list-now
press home-row-*
shows task-page
gone task-loading
press bar-back
shows home-list-now
shoot folded
